  "arrangerNotes": "2/4 time (eighth = 0.5, sixteenth = 0.25 beat). Verse and chorus verified against the two LilyPond scores on French Wikipedia (vocal line only; the piano and choir parts are left out). The chorus is written once (the score marks it to repeat). The slurred pickup (1-2) carries one syllable. No accidentals. Range 1–6, minLayout 8. Medium because of the sixteenth-note pickups and dotted rhythms. C and D arrangements use identical degree sequences (both fit their drums).",
  "verified": true
